}

smells.AssertionRoulette:
Add a descriptive message to each assertEquals call. For example:
```java
assertEquals("a", new UnrecognizedOptionException("a").getMessage(), "Message should be 'a' when constructed with a single argument");
assertEquals("a", new UnrecognizedOptionException("a", "b").getMessage(), "Message should be 'a' when constructed with option and message");
assertEquals("b", new UnrecognizedOptionException("a", "b").getOption(), "Option should be 'b' when constructed with option and message");
```

